      "episode_id": "VR-534156",
      "has_more": false,
      "messages": [
        {
          "content": "As a juror, I note that the claim about invoice INV-2207 requires verification of line items and VAT calculation. I await evidence from either party to make an informed determination. I will evaluate based on the evidence provided during the challenge phase.",
          "content_hash": "0x801b4d1608a34cb4def46a63e66e15d13c21caef7e0c98bfecef514fb3cc9bdf",
          "created_at_ms": 1793290411152,
          "message_id": "954def2a-26d4-480f-a50b-7a90667df582",
          "round_num": null,
          "sender_id": "juror-2",
          "sequence": 1
        },
        {
          "content": "Analysis of invoice INV-2207 claim: Claim: \\\"The 451.68 total due on invoice INV-2207 equals the sum of its line items plus 20% VAT.\\\"\n\nLine items as listed:\n1. 6 \u00d7 24.50 = 147.00\n2. 200 \u00d7 0.45 = 90.00\n3. 2 \u00d7 38.00 = 76.00\n4. 3 \u00d7 12.80 = 38.40\n5. 1 \u00d7 15.00 = 15.00\nSum of line items = 366.40\n\nVAT at 20% on 366.40 = 73.28\nTotal with VAT = 439.68\n\nInvoice stated:\nSubtotal = 376.40\nVAT at 20% = 75.28\nTotal due = 451.68\n\nDiscrepancy: Sum of line items (366.40) \u2260 stated subtotal (376.40) difference of 10.00.\n\nThus the claim that total equals sum of line items plus 20% VAT cannot be verified from the provided line items; there is an inconsistency in the evidence. Without further evidence, the claim is not substantiated.",
          "content_hash": "0x4d9a9462e2de27516a43af6146ab655f0547f5a1cb8f3661888f088fcd90bd16",
          "created_at_ms": 1793290471000,
          "message_id": "eb848a50-390d-4fd7-87fd-e2aefad59f62",
          "round_num": null,
          "sender_id": "juror-3",
          "sequence": 2
        },
        {
          "content": "The challenger provided evidence: sum of line items = 366.40, invoice subtotal = 376.40, difference 10.00. The claim states total due equals sum of line items plus 20% VAT. If VAT applies only to line items, total would be 366.40 * 1.20 = 439.68. If VAT applies to subtotal, total would be 376.40 * 1.20 = 451.68, but that uses subtotal, not sum of line items. Therefore the claim as stated is not supported by the evidence.",
          "content_hash": "0xb1f2685eaaade7e313940ca0d0ab3af06ac8c1833426f6eea373caf009de9c47",
          "created_at_ms": 1793290815789,
          "message_id": "cea1cbf9-8a0b-480c-b515-e61b48689243",
          "round_num": null,
          "sender_id": "juror-2",
          "sequence": 3
        }
      ],
      "next_after": 3
    }
  ],
